<!--Blurb-->
|blurb        = {{sbc|Innate:}} {{ci|Aphelios}} wields 5 Lunari Weapons made by his sister '''Alune'''. He has access to two at a time: {{as|main weapon}} and {{as|off-hand}} weapon. Each weapon grants him a unique basic attack and a [[File:Q.png|20px|link=]] primary ability.
|blurb2       = {{sbc|Moonlight:}} Attacks and abilities consume a weapon's ammo. When out of ammo, '''Aphelios''' discards the weapon to the reserve and '''Alune''' assembles the next of the 5.
|blurb3       = {{sbc|Weapon Master:}} '''Aphelios''' cannot improve his abilities with skill points, instead he spend those for '''bonus''' stats: {{as|{{sti|attack damage}}}}, {{as|{{sti|attack speed}}}}, and {{as|{{sti|lethality}}}}.
